---
// The overlay is one place to look; these are the others. Each ships in
// the current build. Sample data in the drawings.
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-accent-primary uppercase">
      Always in view
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
      You don't have to be looking at Onyx to be watching
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-text-secondary">
      The same sessions, Claudes, PRs and pipelines follow you to the edge of the screen,
      the desktop, the menu bar and your other Macs, so the one that needs you can find you
      while you're working in something else.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-12 grid items-start gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <!-- Compact window -->
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-secondary/40 p-5 sm:p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-wide text-accent-primary uppercase">
        Compact window &middot; ⇧⌘D
      </p>
      <h3 class="mt-3 font-medium">The side panel, on its own</h3>
      <p class="mt-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
        One shortcut shrinks a window to just simple mode's panel: sessions, what each
        Claude is doing, today's agenda, open PRs with their CI. Park it at the edge of the
        screen beside your editor. Each shape remembers its own size and place.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Widget -->
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-secondary/40 p-5 sm:p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-wide text-accent-primary uppercase">
        Desktop widget
      </p>
      <h3 class="mt-3 font-medium">Onyx Sessions, on the desktop</h3>
      <p class="mt-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
        Your sessions and their Claudes, turning amber when one is waiting for you, and your
        PRs' CI with their label dots where there's room. Click a session and it opens.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-primary/80 p-4 font-mono text-[10px]">
        <p class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-claude"></span>
          <span class="text-text-secondary">api</span>
          <span class="truncate text-claude/80">Edit retry.ts</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-1.5 flex items-baseline gap-2">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-warn"></span>
          <span class="text-warn">billing</span>
          <span class="text-warn/80">waiting for permission</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-1.5 flex items-baseline gap-2">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-claude"></span>
          <span class="text-text-secondary">infra</span>
          <span class="truncate text-claude/80">Bash terraform plan</span>
        </p>
        <div class="mt-3 border-t border-border-subtle pt-2.5">
          <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate font-sans text-text-secondary">Retry policy for the ingest queue</span>
            <span class="h-[6px] w-[6px] rounded-full" style="background:#c06bff"></span>
            <span class="text-accent-primary">integration</span>
          </p>
          <p class="mt-1 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate font-sans text-text-secondary">Billing settings page</span>
            <span class="h-[6px] w-[6px] rounded-full" style="background:#ff6b6b"></span>
            <span class="text-bad">failed</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Menu bar -->
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-secondary/40 p-5 sm:p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-wide text-accent-primary uppercase">
        Menu bar
      </p>
      <h3 class="mt-3 font-medium">Failures first, from anywhere</h3>
      <p class="mt-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
        Sessions with notes and their unread agent alerts, and every tracked pipeline, red
        ones at the top with their retry attempt and listed by their PR's title. It's one
        click away from any app.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Every Mac -->
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-secondary/40 p-5 sm:p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-wide text-accent-primary uppercase">
        Every Mac you use
      </p>
      <h3 class="mt-3 font-medium">One picture, on the desk and the laptop</h3>
      <p class="mt-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
        Session notes, favorites, tracked pipelines, which workflows and labels you follow,
        and your shared settings sync through a host you choose, merged carefully so neither
        Mac loses anything. Open the laptop and it's watching the same work. No account and
        no cloud service: it's a file on your own machine.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
